# Frontend migration

Read `docs/progress.md` before changing this repo.

- This repo is the Astro starter (`pnpm create astro@latest -- --template minimal`). Do not scaffold a new Astro app.
- The user writes the code. When they ask to start a task, give instructions for that task only. Do not edit application code unless they explicitly ask.
- One task at a time. Plan that task, then build it. Do not plan or build the whole frontend in one shot.
- Prefer official Astro add commands (`astro add node`, and so on) over hand-rolled adapters.
- Do not copy grouplfb snapshot files into this starter. Migrated sites clone this repo and overlay elsewhere.
- GitHub App and Vercel APIs wait until the product plan includes them.
- When the user says a task is done, update the status table in `docs/progress.md`.
